te\\text{-}lattice} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CompleteLattice}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CompleteLattice}_S(X,R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC order definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(X,R)$ is the partial-order predicate (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(X,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CompleteLattice}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CompleteLattice}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}complete\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CompleteLattice}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Poset}(X,R)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\exists u,l\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\\\\n&\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,u\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall v\\in X\\;(\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,v\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle l,a\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall v\\in X\\;(\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle v,a\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle v,l\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr).\n\\en